    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lukghumajeega suuk bea geandeayda riing'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida wassean iyadiiy aba ng'asheanda iiy nea geebaloola nea geegasa gwarugu ng'asheanda aba gideaba niny muushoocheanda gil, aba gideaba gwadeepa ea nidaah ghana ghwanal gida, ak ea marukuna, gayghwanyas ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana gwadeepa ghoang'waay siida wassean gidamuy, adea musta diyeayda mii miy ghana musta deeda muy ghana ea musta diyeanga badiina ng'eanyi, nea mwanala niny, ak ea mudaamiy, gayghwanyas riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana iyang'waay gidamuy aba heeda siida, was gida wassean nyooh ea miimiy jea ghwanung' ea mwamiina siida, nea mwanala niny, iidu nea ghwanal gayghwanyas riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana iirugu iiyak siida habeawooda muy aba ghuutaanyi ak gwasin gidamuy ghana gwasin gidamiy, ng'asheanda wassean was habeawooda miy ak siida, ak ea mwanala, iidu nea ghwanal gayghwanyas riing'eeda aba jeemba giliwas ng'ashaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iideepa ea niidiiy aba jeemba ng'asheanjagi aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu, gaygwaduukuuna riing'eeda sin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygweadu haleanjeadaanyi bea habeawooda bea giidiinyeanda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda riing'eeda sin, was gisilleanda saawaat leabu jeeda hawanda nooga ea dayeenda gisilleanda ghanea mbooyda, ghoah haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba riing'eeda; ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi aba riing'eadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama deepa ea meamu ghwanyas dayeenda gisilleanda, abeeda gaygweadu haleanjeeda ghadooweeda deaschi sea giidiinyeanda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda riing'eeda sin, ghariibaji iyeenya hees ghana dayi iyeenya bea ghariibajeanda mwanang' agi gaygaba haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea badayda riing'eeda nea niirja gaygaba haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygweadu sean haleanjeeni heeda ashoohoocheanda, ak gayghoadayda aba badayda riing'eeda; ak gayghwalach uhuuda gooheeli sea gheata, ak ea mahirja geapkeeda gheata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwasaksa foojeanda mwaatkwa bea gidasighadoawanda aba riing'eeda heeda wagiida, nea foojeanda abit gajeehiisa heeda wagiida; suh haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghoadayda deaba iyeenya ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda jea eaghwarda aba gidarugu deaweeda; ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheadaanyi aba riing'eeda nisin, ak gajeesamsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama deepa ea mweamu ghoadayda ghariibajeesu hees iyeenya ghana dayi iyeenya bea ghariibajeanda, abeeda gaygweadu ghoah haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda aba badayda riing'eeda ghayi sin, gilagi aba jeeda damanamughuush bea giloohaji damanamughuush bea dearanga miyaasiin ghoah gidasighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda; ak ea maygooguuyi nagheeda, ak ea maygooguuyi geediga ng'andidi, aba gideaba haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygweadu heeda ashoohoocheanda, ak gaygageanu ashoohoocheanda ak ghoanyiit geatinda ghoah gichea eapkaada ak ghaghwarda aba heeda wagiida, ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA; nih haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi aba riing'eeda nisin aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu, ak gajeesamsa. Abeeda gea abit gaygaba ashoohoocheanda, gawuurji sea booga sighadoawanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea leadeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi siida wassean isin ng'asheanda nea mabaysiina aba jeemba ng'asheanjagi aba jeeda gea ghaydidi bea NG'UTAMIIDA, gaygweadu haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba giidiinyeanda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was lagweenda manda sirjeeda aba jeeda hawandaanyi bea nooga nea gigali sheayeadaanyi shiliingajeanda, was shekeeleeda heeda ghaydit; suh haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghoadayda waliida shoada bea ginisin aba gidaghaydit, ak gideaba muut gayghoadaw ashoohoocheanda; ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi aba laghweenda was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda, ak gajeesamsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama deepa goodiiy siida wassean, ak gwasin ng'asheanjagi aba jeeda ng'asheega rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba majeesin, earapeadi mwanalaan, niidiiy ak gayghwanyas ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygweasa ashoohoocheanda lagweenda manda sirjeeda jea gwaleabu jeeda hawanda noagaaschi, nea gigali sheayeadaanyi dea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea giidiinyeanda, ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi aba ramaseanda sin nea mabaysiina, ak gajeesamsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gidasighadoawanda aba giidiinyeanda; ak ea niidiiy aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
